      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The current instance join queue system does not allow for immediate return when an event performer from a full instance times out due to trouble.\n\nAlso, in the case of a late join, the specification is that they cannot return until someone drops out of the instance.\n\nWe think this is a little insufficient for active use at an event.\n\nIn order to use the group instance more actively, we think it is necessary to have the right to force people to join.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
